  add_requirement,atc4,"design-docs-ssot","产品 TUI 视觉与 UX MUST 以 src/app/tui/DESIGN.md 为索引、以 src/app/tui/design/*.md 为组件级 SSOT；实现与 demo 引用组件规则时 MUST 指向对应子文档（尤其 design/diff-block.md 与 design/keybindings.md），MUST NOT 仅依赖口头约定。",null,null,null
